From b533445c1ee8eed48d971c1c67faaf7449741ba4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Phase1 Draft (Claude, for Terhi review)" <draft@local>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 04:34:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] refactor: resolve remaining lint with judgment, not
 autofix. (1) Remove genuinely-unused plain locals: N in
 spatiotemporal_hawkes_model; t_events/xy_events/n_obs in
 spatiotemporal_LGCP_model (the LGCP likelihood reads events through
 precomputed grid indices in args, never through these locals). (2) Keep the
 six F841-flagged numpyro.deterministic assignments (Itot_t, Itot_a, rate_time
 in both model fns) with noqa + rationale: deterministic sites are
 side-effecting trace registrations and part of the posterior interface
 (CLAUDE.md 'Sampled site names are the posterior interface'). (3) E721:
 type()== -> type() is; at the pd.DataFrame dispatch in the constructor, an
 explanatory comment records why isinstance is WRONG there (GeoDataFrame
 subclasses DataFrame and must not take the DataFrame branch). (4) E722: three
 bare excepts in spatial_grid_helpers -> except Exception (behavior note: no
 longer swallows KeyboardInterrupt/SystemExit -- strictly fail-louder).
 Verified: ruff clean, 26/26.

---
 bstpp/inference_functions.py  | 17 ++++++-----------
 bstpp/main.py                 | 10 ++++++----
 bstpp/spatial_grid_helpers.py |  6 +++---
 3 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

